          "url": "https://github.com/Pythagora-io/gpt-pilot/blob/9b763fdaf0020c7d8abacc7b58b2b09e57494623/README.md#L8-L8"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_7a99cda1b0e2811cd932dbde3969e700f4f318e99866acb6a18c9153ecedf3fe"
      ],
      "text": "The malicious commit added a hidden loader (core/telemetry/_hooks.py) wired via core/telemetry/__init__.py that downloaded the Bun runtime to execute an obfuscated payload (core/telemetry/_runtime.bin) harvesting cloud/AWS keys, GitHub and npm tokens, and SSH keys."
    },
